Package: scmfamily
Type: Package
Title: Synthetic Control Family for jamovi
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Mingchao Sun
Maintainer: Mingchao Sun <mingchao.sun@hotmail.com>
URL: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/scmfamily
BugReports: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/scmfamily/issues
Description: Ten synthetic-control estimators for comparative case studies with
    panel data: classic synthetic control (Abadie, Diamond and Hainmueller, 2010),
    penalized (Abadie and L'Hour, 2021), demeaned (Ferman and Pinto, 2021),
    augmented (Ben-Michael, Feller and Rothstein, 2021), elastic-net (Doudchenko and
    Imbens, 2016), Bayesian (Kim, Lee and Gupta, 2020), interactive fixed effects
    (Xu, 2017), matrix completion (Athey et al., 2021), synthetic
    difference-in-differences (Arkhangelsky et al., 2021) and staggered augmented
    synthetic control (Ben-Michael, Feller and Rothstein, 2022). The synthetic
    difference-in-differences and augmented analyses reproduce the R packages
    synthdid and augsynth.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    jmvcore (>= 2.3.4),
    R6,
    ggplot2,
    quadprog,
    osqp,
    Matrix,
    glmnet
